        <div class="button-section"><p class="engraved">TACTILE / 按下即有回应</p><div class="key-row"><button class="hardware-key" :aria-pressed="pressed" :disabled="!enabled" @click="pressed=!pressed"><span aria-hidden="true">{{pressed?'■':'▶'}}</span><small>{{pressed?'停止':'启动'}}</small></button><button class="hardware-key" @click="intensity=64;pressed=false"><span aria-hidden="true">↺</span><small>复位</small></button><button class="hardware-key" disabled><span aria-hidden="true">＋</span><small>锁定</small></button></div><label class="switch-label" data-milk-press-target data-milk-press-kind="switch"><span><b>仪表电源</b><small>POWER / ON · OFF</small></span><input v-model="enabled" type="checkbox" role="switch" aria-label="仪表电源"/><span class="physical-switch milk-relief milk-relief-tabbar" aria-hidden="true"><span class="switch-state">{{enabled?'开':'关'}}</span><i class="milk-relief milk-relief-control"/></span></label><p class="bench-note" role="status">{{!enabled?'待机中，强度控制已禁用。':pressed?`本地演示运行中 · 强度 ${intensity}`:'轻按按键，感受下沉与回位；滑动刻度，观察强度变化。'}}</p></div>
      </TabsContent>
      <TabsContent value="navigation" class="instrument-content navigation-panel"><div><p class="engraved">SOFT NAVIGATION</p><h3>让每一次切换，都有落点。</h3><p>导航安放在凹槽中，选中项由细微高光与投影托起。左右方向键切换，Tab 键进入内容。</p></div><div class="nav-model milk-relief milk-relief-card" aria-hidden="true"><div class="mini-well milk-relief milk-relief-tabbar"><span class="milk-relief milk-relief-control">概览</span><span class="active milk-relief milk-relief-control">工作台</span><span class="milk-relief milk-relief-control">资源</span></div><div class="ruler"/><strong class="engraved">WORKSPACE / 02</strong></div></TabsContent>
